  "description": "At twenty, I thought my first summer would be a little special. I expected to move to Seoul and date a sweet city guy, but reality is working a bingsu part-time job with my hometown guy friend! \n\nWe've been like siblings since childhood. Brash and shameless Jang Je-Yeol was definitely not dating material. But is it because I'm drunk on the summer heat? I impulsively ended up kissing Jang Je-Yeol. \n\n\"Why... does he look handsome to me?\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4895003876)",
